defmodule Solution do
  @moduledoc """
  Provides functionality to calculate the minimum cost to climb the staircase.
  """

  @doc """
  Returns the minimum cost to climb the staircase.

  You can start from step 0 or step 1, and you can climb one or two steps at a time.
  The cost of a step is paid when you land on it. You must reach beyond the last step.

  ## Examples

      iex> Solution.min_cost_climbing_stairs([1, 100, 1, 1, 1, 100, 1, 1, 100, 1])
